From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kutuzov <oleksii.kutuzov@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cargo.lock: sync workspace package versions

The 2.3.2 release updated each workspace manifest but retained the 2.3.1
workspace package versions in Cargo.lock. Newer Cargo therefore refuses to
build with --frozen. Synchronize the four local package entries with their
manifests; third-party dependency resolution is unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 Cargo.lock | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 6a144de..4332af5 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -1965 +1965 @@ name = "pisugar-core"
-version = "2.3.1"
+version = "2.3.2"
@@ -1980 +1980 @@ name = "pisugar-poweroff"
-version = "2.3.1"
+version = "2.3.2"
@@ -1991 +1991 @@ name = "pisugar-programmer"
-version = "2.3.1"
+version = "2.3.2"
@@ -2002 +2002 @@ name = "pisugar-server"
-version = "2.3.1"
+version = "2.3.2"
